    <string name="mac_help_button">Where do I find the MAC?</string>
    <string name="mac_help_title">Find the MAC address</string>
    <string name="mac_help_windows">Windows: in a terminal, run getmac /v and copy the “Physical Address” of the Ethernet adapter.</string>
    <string name="mac_help_macos">macOS: System Settings → Network → your connection → Details → Hardware.</string>
    <string name="mac_help_linux">Linux: run ip link and copy the link/ether address of the wired interface.</string>
    <string name="mac_help_tip">Pick the wired (Ethernet) adapter: Wake-on-LAN rarely works over Wi-Fi.</string>

